The comanager/ directory is derived from Fantasy-Football-AI-CoManager by
JayMishra-source (https://github.com/JayMishra-source/Fantasy-Football-AI-CoManager),
which its README states is released under the MIT License.

Changes in this repository: new league tools (fantasy-engine/mcp-server/src/tools/league.ts),
a cached ESPN request helper and player name search in
fantasy-engine/mcp-server/src/services/espnApi.ts, and the corresponding tool
registrations in fantasy-engine/mcp-server/src/index-new.ts.
